    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_body">Whisprompt was made so you can read your own scripts on your Even G2 glasses anywhere — on stage, in a meeting, on the street, on camera — without depending on the internet. No account, no cloud, no tracking: your text stays on your phone and works even in airplane mode. Built by someone who just wanted to use their glasses wherever they want — and to keep that freedom for everyone.</string>
