    <!-- Help / FAQ -->
    <string name="faq_title">Help &amp; FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq_q_modes">What are Public and Rental modes?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_modes">Public mode is the normal app — anyone can open it, with free-plan limits. Rental mode locks access behind an admin passcode and one-time guest codes, for lending the glasses to others.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_glasses">How do I pick a text on the glasses?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_glasses">Open the app from the glasses menu. Swipe the touchbar to move through your texts, single-tap to start the selected one, double-tap to go home.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_auto">What does Auto mode do?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_auto">In Auto mode the text scrolls on its own at your reading speed (WPM). The estimated time to read the whole text is shown next to the speed.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_limits">What are the free-plan limits?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_limits">Free plan: up to 2 texts, 100 words each. Premium removes both limits.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_premium">How does buying Premium work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_premium">Tap Buy Premium and confirm the payment. Once your bank/Google Play confirms it, Premium unlocks automatically. Use Restore purchase on a new device.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_lang">Can I change the language?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_lang">Yes — pick a language in Settings. The glasses menu follows the same language.</string>

