    <!-- FAQ: background/battery + restore Even app -->
    <string name="faq_q_battery">Does the app run in the background?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_battery">Yes. While connected to the glasses it keeps a background service (with a notification) so the link stays alive — this can use extra battery. Tap Disconnect (in the app or the notification) to stop it.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_even">How do I restore the full Even app interface?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_even">Just open and connect with the official Even app — it brings back the full standard interface on the glasses.</string>
    <string name="faq_q_ring">Does it work with the R1 ring?</string>
    <string name="faq_a_ring">Not yet — R1 ring control is coming soon. For now use the glasses touchbar (customizable in Settings) or your phone. Ring support is in the works.</string>
